What’s included:
- JLCPCB-imported `RP2040`, USB-C receptacle, AP2112K 3.3 V regulator, and W25Q16 flash under [imports/](/workspace/imports)
- USB-C VBUS, D+/D-, CC pulldowns, 3.3 V regulation
- QSPI flash, 12 MHz crystal, decoupling, RUN pullup
- GPIO25 status LED
- Two 10-pin breakout headers: GPIO0-GPIO11, SWD, RUN, BOOTSEL, VBUS, 3V3, GND
- Routing enabled; no `routingDisabled` usage

